# The control. Reach wherever the game gets to on its own, press nothing, stop.
#
# This is not optional. Without a run that goes the same distance and touches
# no buttons, "New Game causes the fault" and "anything past forty seconds
# causes the fault" produce identical evidence. Run it whenever new-game.pad
# reproduces something, and expect `bad mem: 0`.

drain 300

  mark "idle: no input will be delivered in this run"
  @900  mark "still idle"
  @1800 stop
